━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ NeonStackBorder is BorderPainter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BorderPainter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ border-insets Insets
    - node Box

Insets(2, 2, 2, 2)

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

. outer = BorderChars("╔", "╗", "╚", "╝", "═", "║")
paint-border-frame(rect, outer, aqua, canvas)

. inner-chars = BorderChars("┌", "┐", "└", "┘", "─", "│")
paint-border-frame(rect.inset(Insets(1, 1, 1, 1)), inner-chars, fuchsia, canvas)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ DropShadowBorder is BorderPainter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BorderPainter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ border-insets Insets
    - node Box

Insets(1, 2, 2, 1)

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

. frame = rect.inset(Insets(0, 1, 1, 0))
. chars = BorderChars("┏", "┓", "┗", "┛", "━", "┃")
paint-border-frame(frame, chars, white, canvas)

. shadow-x = rect.right - 1
. shadow-y-start = rect.y + 1
. shadow-y-end = rect.bottom
for y in shadow-y-start .. < shadow-y-end
    paint-cell(canvas, shadow-x, y, "▓", black)

. shadow-y = rect.bottom - 1
. shadow-x-start = rect.x + 1
. shadow-x-end = rect.right
for x in shadow-x-start .. < shadow-x-end
    paint-cell(canvas, x, shadow-y, "▒", black)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ SignalBorder is BorderPainter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BorderPainter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ border-insets Insets
    - node Box

Insets(1, 1, 1, 1)

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

=? if rect.width <= 0 || rect.height <= 0

for x in rect.x .. < rect.right
    . mark = signal-mark(x)
    paint-cell(canvas, x, rect.y, mark, signal-color(x))
    paint-cell(canvas, x, rect.bottom - 1, mark, signal-color((x + 2)))
for y in rect.y + 1 .. < rect.bottom - 1
    paint-cell(canvas, rect.x, y, "╏", signal-color(y))
    paint-cell(canvas, rect.right - 1, y, "╏", signal-color((y + 2)))

