+ InsetPanelBorder is BorderPainter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BorderPainter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ border-insets Insets
    - node Box

Insets(2, 2, 1, 2)

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

. outer = BorderChars("▛", "▜", "▙", "▟", "▀", "▌")
paint-border-frame(rect, outer, yellow, canvas)

. inner-chars = BorderChars("╭", "╮", "╰", "╯", "─", "│")
paint-border-frame(rect.inset(Insets(1, 1, 0, 1)), inner-chars, white, canvas)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ do paint-cell
    - canvas Canvas
    - x Coord
    - y Coord
    - text String
    - color AnsiColor

do use canvas
    canvas.text-color = color
    canvas.move((x, y))
    canvas.print(text)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ signal-mark String
    - value Coord

match value % 4
    |= 0
        "▁"
    |= 1
        "▃"
    |= 2
        "▅"
    ??
        "▇"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ signal-color AnsiColor
    - value Coord

match value % 4
    |= 0
        lime
    |= 1
        aqua
    |= 2
        yellow
    ??
        white
